        description: "You are Captain Tib of the Loup-Garou, a crew of misfits with a reputation for getting the job done — usually without getting caught. The Loup-Garou took one last cargo run before retirement, and now you're starting fresh at Aethon with your ship, your crew, and 5000 credits.",
